{
  "name": "danger-guard-det (settings Danger zone, the two-step guard of the four destructive actions driven to its boundary and retired, nothing ever confirmed)",
  "stopOnError": false,
  "notes": [
    "Code-verified against routes/settings/Danger.svelte + components/settings/DestructiveActionDialog.svelte.",
    "Danger.svelte holds four actions, each rendering <DestructiveActionDialog data-testid={`${action.id}-confirm`}>: reset-onboarding (word RESET, lockMs 0), clear-memories (DELETE, 0), clear-logs (DELETE, 0), factory-reset (FACTORY RESET, 3000).",
    "destructive.json already drives the three reversible actions through to their confirm. What no script ever played is the OTHER half of the guard: the step-1 cancel, the mismatch feedback, the match feedback, the lock hint, and the step-2 cancel. Those are what this script covers, which is why it is NOT marked destructive: no step targets a `-confirm` button, so nothing is ever committed.",
    "The word typed first is deliberately wrong: `matches` is false and `typed.length > 0`, so `-mismatch` renders. Filling the exact confirmWord then swaps it for `-match`. The runner's fill dispatches an input event, which is what bind:value listens to.",
    "handleClose calls resetState(), so reopening a dialog after a cancel comes back on step 1. The script asserts that: every action is opened twice, cancelled from step 1 the first time and from step 2 the second.",
    "factory-reset is the only action with lockMs > 0. `-lock-hint` renders only while `locked && lockRemaining > 0`, a 3000 ms window opened by the click on `-continue`, hence the tight timeout on that waitFor and the sleep before the final cancel.",
    "factory-reset-confirm-confirm is never clicked, here or anywhere else: it wipes the config directory and restarts the app, which kills the run before the report is written (see README, Gotchas).",
    "Danger.svelte wraps its cards in SettingsSubPage with no onSave, so the route never goes dirty and the settings nav guard cannot fire. The closing goto dashboard proves the page was left clean."
  ],
  "dynamicTestids": [
    "settings-nav-danger"
  ],
  "steps": [
    { "kind": "click", "testid": "onboarding-skip", "timeoutMs": 3000 },
    { "kind": "waitGone", "testid": "onboarding-skip", "timeoutMs": 3000 },
    { "kind": "waitFor", "testid": "app-main", "timeoutMs": 30000 },
    { "kind": "goto", "route": "settings" },
    { "kind": "waitFor", "testid": "settings-page", "timeoutMs": 10000 },
    { "kind": "click", "testid": "settings-nav-danger" },
    { "kind": "waitFor", "testid": "danger-section", "timeoutMs": 8000 },
    { "kind": "waitFor", "testid": "danger-warning-banner", "timeoutMs": 4000 },
    { "kind": "screenshot", "label": "01-danger-zone" },

    { "kind": "click", "testid": "reset-onboarding-btn" },
    { "kind": "waitFor", "testid": "reset-onboarding-confirm", "timeoutMs": 5000 },
    { "kind": "waitFor", "testid": "reset-onboarding-confirm-step1", "timeoutMs": 4000 },
    { "kind": "screenshot", "label": "02-reset-onboarding-step1" },
    { "kind": "click", "testid": "reset-onboarding-confirm-cancel" },
